      "name": "dsh-project-gallery",
      "title": {
        "en": "Project Gallery",
        "zh": "项目相册"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Gathers session attachments and project-directory images into one album per project: hover a workspace row for a preview, open a panel or the global album, and the lightbox shows the prompt/context behind each image. Reads local files only, no network, no telemetry; zero runtime dependencies.",
        "zh": "把会话附件与项目目录里的图按项目攒成一册：悬停工作区行看预览，打开侧栏面板或全局相册，灯箱里带每张图当时对应的对话诉求与进展。只读本机文件、不发网络请求、无遥测；零运行时依赖。"
      },
